<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun" source-id="s-songshu-047-liudaocun-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001:m0001" ref="h1l_zwj_gdd">道存</persName>嗣。太祖元嘉末，為太尉江夏王<persName id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001:m0017" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">義恭</persName>諮議參軍。世祖伐元凶，義軍至新亭，<persName id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001:m0036" ref="h1l_zwj_gdd">道存</persName>出奔，元凶殺其母以徇。前廢帝景和中，為<persName id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001:m0057" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">義恭</persName>太宰從事中郎，<persName id="c-songshu-047-liudaocun:p001:m0066" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">義恭</persName>敗，以黨與下獄死。</p>
</text>
